# Dev Notes 15 — Runtime Lifecycle Init Coordinator v1

Date: 2026-05-28
Branch: `runtime-lifecycle-modularization-v1-init-coordinator`
Source base: `runtime-dev-repo-modularization.zip`
Observed source ZIP SHA-256: `cd693011ca701919f9d627a6a703ca1c53b60ece1f6709e225ec68e869ac9dc0`

## Status

```text
STAGED / MOCK-SANDBOX VERIFIED
```

These notes record the behavior-preserving init coordinator extraction from `inference.mjs`.

## Purpose

The purpose of this branch is to reduce `inference.mjs` responsibility load by moving parent-side initialization orchestration into:

```text
runtimeInitCoordinator.mjs
```

The public API export remains in `inference.mjs`:

```js
export async function initModel(options = {}) {
    return initModelCoordinator(createInitCoordinatorContext(), options);
}
```

`prompt()` still remains in `inference.mjs` and still performs admission checks before and after readiness. It now calls the coordinator readiness helper:

```js
await ensureModelReadyCoordinator(createInitCoordinatorContext());
```

`resetModel()` remains in `inference.mjs`. Only its re-init sub-step was delegated:

```js
await reinitializeModelAfterReset(createInitCoordinatorContext());
```

