## Behavior moved

Moved from `inference.mjs` into `runtimeInitCoordinator.mjs`:

```text
init option key validation
hardwareAware option normalization
init retry option resolution
hardware probe decision logic
worker config snapshot creation for init attempts
init profile and attempt-plan creation
last-success fixed init plan creation
single-attempt init send/timeout behavior
init retry cycle execution
final init error construction
explicit initModel coordination
ensureModelReady / prompt auto-init coordination
resetModel re-init planning/execution helper
```

## Behavior intentionally not moved

The following remain in `inference.mjs`:

```text
public API exports
prompt admission and queueing
cancelPrompt
resetSession public wrapper
resetModel orchestration
shutdownRuntime public wrapper
worker message router
ready/init-error router handling
scheduler ownership
workerBridge ownership
request cancellation loops
request settlement calls
native boundary/unhealthy coordination calls
```

This branch intentionally does not extract the model reset coordinator, worker protocol router, scheduler, worker bridge, or any worker-local behavior.

## Coordinator interface

`runtimeInitCoordinator.mjs` exports:

```js
export async function initModelCoordinator(ctx, options = {}) {}
export async function ensureModelReadyCoordinator(ctx) {}
export async function startInitCycle(ctx, initPlan) {}
export async function reinitializeModelAfterReset(ctx) {}
```

`inference.mjs` supplies a narrow context object:

```js
function createInitCoordinatorContext() {
    return {
        config,
        lifecycle,
        scheduler,
        sendToWorker,
        terminateWorker,
        recreateWorker,
        assertRuntimeHealthy
    };
}
```

## Behavior preservation notes

The extraction preserves the current parent-side init behavior:

```text
explicit init still rejects during runtime unhealthy, shutdown, or reset
explicit init after ready still rejects meaningful init options
explicit duplicate init still rejects while init is active
prompt auto-init still waits on the full init cycle
failed explicit custom/profile init still blocks unsafe silent default auto-init
retry attempts still use the same attempt-plan generation semantics
worker terminate/recreate ordering during init retry is preserved
ready timeout behavior is preserved
last successful effective config reuse is preserved
resetModel still reinitializes before resolving
active init attempt id / stale ready-message protection remains router-owned in inference.mjs
```

