## Known caveats

Real-runtime tests were not run in the sandbox. They require Michael's local environment with `node-llama-cpp` and model files available.

The worker message router remains in `inference.mjs` by design. The ready/init-error branches still directly mutate lifecycle state, because router extraction is a later branch.

`resetModel()` remains in `inference.mjs` by design. This branch delegates only the re-init planning/execution sub-step to avoid mixing model reset extraction with init coordinator extraction.

